    "enUS": {
      "description": "<Penned in faded ink, the note is requesting oa Dark Leather Tunic, along with information about delivery location and payment. At the bottom appears text denoting this writ is transferable.>",
      "dialogue": {
        "60b09100765d07b646b3": "WHAT???"
